  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If a rectangle is inscribed in an equilateral triangle of side length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;as shown in the figure, then the square of the largest area of such a rectangle is _____.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1ad3b0a2-a500-4ced-aa96-c4d85192c510-image.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 141px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d3836c55-89f3-4bed-8b32-74fba6e55210-image.png\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 179px;\" /></p><p>In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math>Area of rectangle</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On differentiating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#8467;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
